plugin-hostd (0.13.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * release: plugin-hostd 0.13.1
  * Test the xruns windows against the fake worker, and break each guard
    (#187)
  * Fold a window's xruns into every member of the worker (#187)
  * The relay keeps the last xruns count each worker wrote (#187)
  * tests: the pool's order, trees, ports and lock are tested, and each guard
    has a sabotage arm
  * sabotage: run the arms in the pool, in a tree of their own each (#206)
  * tests: a pool that runs sabotage arms side by side and prints them in
    table order
  * Declare the worker's xruns line and hold its word to omx-clap-core's,
    raising the floor to 0.23.0 (#187)

